        <strong>Complete and indexable</strong>
      </div>
      <h2>Canada</h2>
      <p>Emergency 911. Missing-person reports should go to local police or the RCMP detachment serving the area.</p>
      <p><strong>{{ ci_ca_count }}</strong> active public cases are currently connected to this country profile.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Official reporting: local police or RCMP</li>
        <li>Country page: active cases, safe sharing, RCMP links</li>
        <li>Languages: English, French</li>
      </ul>
